#: src/page/docs/customize-feed/customize-feed.jsx:78
msgid "Layout tab"
msgstr ""

#: src/page/docs/customize-feed/customize-feed.jsx:79
msgid "Columns per screen size (for a Slider: how many slides are visible), Max Posts, which card details to show (account name, title, description, likes, date) and the Click Action."
msgstr ""

#: src/page/docs/customize-feed/customize-feed.jsx:80
msgid "Show Posts picks which posts the feed lists: All, only Videos, only Photos (albums included) or Text Only (posts without a photo or video). The feed still fills its Max Posts with matching posts."
msgstr ""

#: src/page/docs/customize-feed/customize-feed.jsx:81
msgid "For the Social Post designs, Caption sets how long captions behave: \"Show More\" cuts them after a number of characters with a Show More / Show Less link (both texts can be changed), \"Scroll\" shows them in a fixed-height box with a scrollbar."
msgstr ""

#: src/page/docs/customize-feed/customize-feed.jsx:83
msgid "Behaviors tab"
msgstr ""

#: src/page/docs/customize-feed/customize-feed.jsx:84
msgid "Equal Card Height for grids (cards in a row get the same height and their header, caption, image and likes line up; turned off, every card keeps its own height), Auto Slide, Infinite Loop and arrow offsets for sliders, and Pagination (Load More with Initial Posts and Posts Per Click). Only the options that apply to your layout are shown."
msgstr ""

#: src/page/docs/customize-feed/customize-feed.jsx:86
msgid "Styles tab"
msgstr ""

#: src/page/docs/customize-feed/customize-feed.jsx:87
msgid "Color Mode (Light or Dark) sets the starting colors of the cards. Then: card background (solid or gradient), border, margin, padding, shadow and gaps; color and typography for the title (account name on Social Post), caption and stats; border and shadow for the image. Social Post also gets the Show More / Less link color and typography, or in Scroll mode the box height and the scrollbar width, radius and colors. The Playlist layout has its own panels for the featured post and the list. Every row has a reset icon."
msgstr ""

#: src/page/docs/customize-feed/customize-feed.jsx:89
#: src/page/edit_feed/edit_feed.jsx:1994
