msgid "Steps 1 and 3-4 differ slightly: you'll upload the plugin from its GitHub Releases zip instead of searching WordPress.org, generate a WordPress Application Password under your user profile, and paste both the site's MCP endpoint and that password into Claude Desktop's MCP config file (Settings → Developer → Edit Config) rather than a Connectors screen."
